  6. Positioned upstream at `80c97fd0` via `jj new ktrmontt`.
  7. Ran `diff -r --brief "$SRC" "$UP"` with ignore list: `Cargo.toml`,
     `Cargo.toml.orig`, `.cargo_vcs_info.json`, `.cargo-ok`,
